{"title":"If I Don’t Die Soon, I Will Rule The Demon Realm","synopsis":"Ye Ning memperoleh “jari emas” melalui perjalanan, dan selama dia masih hidup, dia akan menjadi tak terkalahkan.\n\nJadi dia mulai bertindak gila. Tapi…\n\nPermaisuri Da Zhou: “Ketika aku melihat kehidupan Ye Ning, jika dia mati, aku akan hidup sendirian.”\n\nPenguasa abadi dunia atas: “Dunia ini begitu acuh tak acuh, tapi Tuan Ye tidak pernah membenciku, aku akan berusaha sekuat mungkin untuk melindunginya.”\n\nRatusan juta orang: “Setiap orang di dunia ini bisa kekurangan, tapi Tuan Ye adalah satu-satunya saint, hanya Ye Ning’er!”\n\nYe Ning: Aku hampir tak terkalahkan, mengapa kalian tidak membiarkanku mati?","alternative_title":"再不死我就统治魔界了","author":"阳光","artist":"绘世TONY","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Harem","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"32c57d75-c0ec-478f-b79a-e4ac64c9a64d","number":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"id":"b44b2b4d-c745-47a3-a878-5c638a2f3d7f","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2025-12-24","images":[]},{"id":"71cc4104-4f18-45f8-94f3-a505d3ce3727","number":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2025-12-21","images":[]},{"id":"37569d24-b883-4cf6-8cfc-52be7b882a07","number":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"id":"d6ed4a44-4913-475b-8f23-3324d08dda65","number":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"id":"8d91f0e2-a41d-4eeb-b178-1ea286f51b2b","number":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2025-12-04","images":[]},{"id":"4976fbe6-4950-491c-a50d-937b7f170e4e","number":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2025-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"3e7bd445-a69f-496a-9c48-d96525bfa84e","number":"109","title":"Chapter 109","date":"2025-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"8ae2f451-bf74-4b7a-aa35-f1d543bc8027","number":"108","title":"Chapter 108","date":"2025-11-22","images":[]},{"id":"8bae5069-db8a-4d19-bead-48f7f38f8742","number":"107","title":"Chapter 107","date":"2025-11-04","images":[]},{"id":"4965e8d9-